Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:06.04,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}“欢迎光临”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.79,0:03:18.26,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}云海流过 硝烟四起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:21.63,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}散落的符号是变位字谜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.63,0:03:26.51,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}徘徊于猜忌和爱慕之间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:28.64,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}谁可主宰沉浮?
