Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.44,0:03:33.06,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}勇士与懦夫的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:34.69,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}奏响破绽的序曲(Overture)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:38.03,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}纯白色的人偶剧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.03,0:03:41.03,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}空虚无力的循环 万般才华无处施展
