Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:07.72,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Zugzwang Du-Ra-ta-ta
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.72,0:04:09.22,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}弱小的棋子啊 舞动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:11.02,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Zugzwang Du-Ra-ta-ta
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:14.81,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}在我的掌心上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.31,0:04:14.65,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Zugzwang Du-Ra-ta-ta
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:18.32,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}直面黑白交锋 爬向前方
