Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:15.05,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}不公的世界(All right)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.05,0:23:17.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}只要放弃就无法改变
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.86,0:23:20.91,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}不公的发展(OMG)
